## Consistency

`/eng-sync` (or `sync_commitments.py <root> check`) proves every listed section states its row's
value verbatim, and `eng-check` warns on drift. The sign-off sheet (`signoff_sheet.md` + `.xlsx`)
is generated from this register — never edited by hand.
